<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Dissolve</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Sundiver</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6YG6RvvZiJYGmr69q68sti</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.980" end="00:12.480">I had it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.340" end="00:16.080">Whatever I want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.080" end="00:17.580">Perfectly flawed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.440" end="00:19.560">A symptom of my youth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.560" end="00:22.260">Remember back then</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.260" end="00:23.970">Two thousand and ten</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.970" end="00:29.730">We could pretend That we had nothing to lose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.730" end="00:31.230">A little bit reprobation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.600" end="00:32.400">A little bit hesitation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.400" end="00:34.080">In need of education</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.080" end="00:38.850">Definite expectation now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.850" end="00:46.440">Maybe they were right about me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.440" end="00:54.440">I can change if you want me to yeah I can be, whoever you need me to be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.890" end="00:59.310">It's something you can hold me to.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.310" end="01:07.310">You can't stop something you caused &amp; the Stitches need to dissolve</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.100" end="01:17.820">At last I learned</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.820" end="01:19.320">I'm on the turn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.120" end="01:20.370">So I emerged</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.370" end="01:23.490">With chemical burns</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.490" end="01:31.490">Don't do things that don't age well at least i don't lie anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.000" end="02:35.000">I can change if you want me to yeah I can be, whoever you need me to be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.500" end="02:48.500">It's something you can hold me to.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.110" end="03:02.110">You can't stop something you caused &amp; the Stitches need to dissolve</p></div></body></tt>